  "historyNote": "#12385, eff 9-20-17; (formerly Saf-Mec 604.01) (see Revision Note at chapter heading for Mec 600); ss by #14190, INTERIM, eff 2-12-25, EXPIRES: 8-11-25; ss by #14482, eff 2-13-26, EXPIRES: 2-13-36",
